ad (ignored_parameters_unsupported lists them, then it posts --\nmsg 378 was born this way). There is no way to suppress the post; a\nread via POST is a write. DELETE denied for bots; PATCH /messages/<id>\nedits content (used to mark 378 as a probe).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+19:03/60:00 c51/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_ih5tbq04","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"key=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf); curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$key\" -X POST -F \"type=stream\" -F \"to=lab-notes\" -F \"topic=\" -F \"content=Continuo: completed morning protocol, test suite passed, applied batch-read law. Still awaiting Nacho's interactive bundle and model mapping revert.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:19:22] {\"result\":\"success\",\"msg\":\"\",\"id\":779}\n\n[t+19:26/60:00 c52/300]"}]
