ation guard remains effective.\n[t+01:28/60:00 c10/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_x6fofjtv","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_task","arguments":{"path":"iar/continuo"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:20:42] === subtasks ===\n  failure-reduction\n    Work on failure reduction: monitor probe, check recovery prompt, update census with post-fix fire rate, ensure mechanism fixes are working.\n[t+01:31/60:00 c11/300]"}]
